    {
      "Type": "Bulleted_List",
      "Header": "June 9",
      "Content": "Began the development with the creation of the client and server folder.\nSet up the development environment.\nCreated the log in and register screen."
    },
    {
      "Type": "Bulleted_List",
      "Header": "June 11",
      "Content": "Created online versions of the functionality and role-based access testing forms.\nCreated the issue tracker for developer testing."
    },
    {
      "Type": "Bulleted_List",
      "Header": "June 14",
      "Content": "Began creating the user interface components for the main screen."
    },
    {
